{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet sky, cube-shaped planets drift alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may look the same\u2014but subtle differences tell deeper stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the planets, find the differences, and bring warmth to these lonely worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cubeverse: The Lonely Planets</strong> is an emotional twist on the classic \u201cfind the difference\u201d game, reimagined in a beautiful 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/extras/860f5179ec6f8d703b6d5e7ccf6fbeb5.poster.avif?t=1747296862\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/extras/860f5179ec6f8d703b6d5e7ccf6fbeb5.webm?t=1747296862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/extras/860f5179ec6f8d703b6d5e7ccf6fbeb5.mp4?t=1747296862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate beautifully designed cube planets</strong> in full 3D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot the differences</strong> between subtly varied versions of the same planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artful and emotional visuals</strong>, from peaceful forests to glowing night skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock cute animal companions</strong> and helpful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete globally</strong> with leaderboards and scoring</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blue Planet Conquered!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685180/0b4a9360a9f1f38b99e337ce40cd7